 $\\displaystyle\\int -3+5t^{2}+4t\\,\\mathrm{d}t$." :question/worked-solution "Rewrite as powers, apply the sum and constant factor rules, and integrate each term using $\\int t^p\\,\\mathrm{d}t=t^{p+1}/(p+1)+C$ for $p\\ne-1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int -3+5t^{2}+4t\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\\\ &= \\int\\left(-3+5t^{2}+4t\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\\\ &= -3\\int t^{0}\\,\\mathrm{d}t+5\\int t^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t+4\\int t^{1}\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\\\ &= -3\\left(\\frac{t^{1}}{1}\\right)+5\\left(\\frac{t^{3}}{3}\\right)+4\\left(\\frac{t^{2}}{2}\\right)+C\\\\ &= -3t+\\frac{5t^{3}}{3}+2t^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["field-23a544a5-17fe-5267-a306-ac1aa903b302"] :db/ensure :question/validate} [:db/add 17592186184155 :knowledge-point/questions "question-8a44340b-213b-58c3-a779-fc168a20d6b5"] {:db/id "answer-8230b682-a119-5939-9e1c-325f1757d159" :answer/id #uuid "8230b682-a119-5939-9e1c-325f1757d159" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{16y^{3}}{3}+16y+\\frac{4y^{5}}{5}+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-3b1cf232-79dc-57e3-893c-c88206f74cea" :answer/id #uuid "3b1cf232-79dc-57e3-893c-c88206f74cea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-16y^{3}+16y+\\frac{36y^{5}}{5}+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-f651bc8d-b674-5014-9422-55599195225f" :answer/id #uuid "f651bc8d-b674-5014-9422-55599195225f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{40y^{3}}{3}+16y+5y^{5}+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-6cd6b418-26bc-5cb4-bdcc-7cd1b9dc019d" :answer/id #uuid "6cd6b418-26bc-5cb4-bdcc-7cd1b9dc019d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-8y^{3}+16y+\\frac{9y^{5}}{5}+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-64b5dab1-8e05-53d7-a6e9-fd8177b69af7" :answer/id #uuid "64b5dab1-8e05-53d7-a6e9-fd8177b69af7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{32y^{3}}{3}+16y+\\frac{16y^{5}}{5}+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "field-e51c9a9b-9dda-