ulate $\\displaystyle\\int -2x+3x^{2}-2\\,\\mathrm{d}x$." :question/worked-solution "Rewrite as powers, apply the sum and constant factor rules, and integrate each term using $\\int x^p\\,\\mathrm{d}x=x^{p+1}/(p+1)+C$ for $p\\ne-1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int -2x+3x^{2}-2\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= \\int\\left(-2x+3x^{2}-2\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= -2\\int x^{1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x+3\\int x^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x-2\\int x^{0}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= -2\\left(\\frac{x^{2}}{2}\\right)+3\\left(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}\\right)-2\\left(\\frac{x^{1}}{1}\\right)+C\\\\ &= -x^{2}+x^{3}-2x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["field-3d5c1a3e-d73d-56bf-9625-b3bc17b6556a"] :db/ensure :question/validate} [:db/add 17592186184155 :knowledge-point/questions "question-4c8d5a05-cff7-5f9c-bd78-43aa634a9492"] {:db/id "answer-751e857e-3583-5e12-af08-41a2b7b6478c" :answer/id #uuid "751e857e-3583-5e12-af08-41a2b7b6478c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4x^{3}}{3}+2x^{2}+x+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-5423bd1a-105e-5b13-9d86-923699913f6f" :answer/id #uuid "5423bd1a-105e-5b13-9d86-923699913f6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5x^{3}}{3}+x^{2}+x+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-29775553-08f2-568d-aadc-5e12973d0a43" :answer/id #uuid "29775553-08f2-568d-aadc-5e12973d0a43" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x^{3}}{3}+3x^{2}+x+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-faa25c1c-b9d1-547d-9229-3e912ae73050" :answer/id #uuid "faa25c1c-b9d1-547d-9229-3e912ae73050" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x^{3}+3x^{2}+x+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "answer-e49bce56-1551-5c16-9c86-b3857303a9aa" :answer/id #uuid "e49bce56-1551-5c16-9c86-b3857303a9aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4x^{3}}{3}+x^{2}+x+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "field-2761d594-ddb2-5e7c-a1a5-4974c969f73d" :answer-field/id #uuid "2761d594-ddb2-5e7c